 233:Drivers/Sensors/STTS22H/stts22h.c **** /**
 234:Drivers/Sensors/STTS22H/stts22h.c ****   * @brief  Enable the STTS22H temperature sensor
 235:Drivers/Sensors/STTS22H/stts22h.c ****   * @param  pObj the device pObj
 236:Drivers/Sensors/STTS22H/stts22h.c ****   * @retval 0 in case of success, an error code otherwise
