 257:Drivers/Sensors/STTS22H/stts22h.c **** /**
ARM GAS  /tmp/ccBqBt3d.s 			page 7


 258:Drivers/Sensors/STTS22H/stts22h.c ****   * @brief  Disable the STTS22H temperature sensor
 259:Drivers/Sensors/STTS22H/stts22h.c ****   * @param  pObj the device pObj
 260:Drivers/Sensors/STTS22H/stts22h.c ****   * @retval 0 in case of success, an error code otherwise
